Arguments are:
ticket_kind: required, one of notify|decision|advice
suggestion_type: subtype for this suggestion
title: short user-facing title
message: detailed user-facing message
action_type: action key for accept processing
action_params: optional object for action parameters
trigger_context: optional object with trigger context
trigger_reason: optional short reason
valid_hours: positive integer validity window
status_effect: optional list of status effect tags
speak_tts: optional boolean
